{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b23f476a2f82daa19abbe63f95ae38c419156fbf032b95faec1e4b32bca5415",
      "text": "然后，是第二期节目的录制……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3372afc518a8830a6c88096f0d1192f21cc5001c68b959a2bead8b13df71bf8",
      "text": "那么，接下来介绍下一封来信。\n“失恋了，什么事都提不起劲来”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b68aa39dda9c98c04b28bf2c8ebc72ee24ad95a1cfb03b664d7ef40923caa0f",
      "text": "“希望能得到一句让我振作起来的话”，她是这么说的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c560e8d5fa5c99faf76344bb49591c42d692bd4afe3df2c9afba757372dd2053",
      "text": "正因为内容简单直白，才更能切实感受到\n前来咨询的天使酱的心情呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6741fcc23c668889d1be55cbc8bfaf827d0e1e8c632e45b12abf0b41894cf8c",
      "text": "我想，现在一定满心都是难过的情绪吧。\n但是……未来一定还会迎来新的恋情的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bdfc80c7de07d2771b7eae5203ac1a8a721e3746d337ad42ecf61b5355596bd",
      "text": "在那一天到来之前……我们，\n会一直为了天使酱歌唱下去哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d99401bb806d6404ca7a0f029d68cc23d20fa621f3b6071c014e3122cb399ab",
      "text": "难受的时候，就想想我们吧！\n因为我们无论何时，都会为你加油打气的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db5f2e44f9edbe17db23f063397498e60926bb2bac646ecbbb0ae2d971aadcd1",
      "text": "我们的歌声里，\n蕴含着许许多多送给大家的信息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba31a49be83f0a294f6c7e710f6e54c1f02fc04034dd4bcf10912c9dbd1b250e",
      "text": "……恋爱，并不全都是快乐的事呢。\n难受痛苦的事，也有很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6679d2b9178dfe273d6c497b0a2c9569821c78d1a68b36b34d72146732b12945",
      "text": "虽然我们无法实现大家的恋情，\n但是却可以陪伴在你的心灵身旁。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79528cc4cb09a7d1ebc87ac8528dbc65833cc4c1249314d995fceb4d8e9154a7",
      "text": "觉得痛苦的时候，就请想起还有我们在吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44b85f9f736dcae18b2692da4d63e678a35b4ed929728c82276854953e2cae1f",
      "text": "为了能成为大家的力量，\n我们今后也会继续歌唱下去的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79a9448db1fffddce40dc778396f7478cfe306c3b694356ab798727a50c6aade",
      "text": "谢谢你们送上这么棒的寄语！\n那么在咨询环节的最后，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c894861638f503b6d6820b8bf9dee761ceaab8bbee39e353ef7edaef1ede50",
      "text": "就让我们来听一听Jupiter的歌曲吧。\n这边已经准备好了，北斗君，请报幕吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e657bde3dcf5d34e2d760dfabe045366d540fbe46e45b3908ec8e14e8a216c5",
      "text": "好的。请听我们的歌曲，\n《运命光年》。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000207:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000220:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f68c2df341fbd9941fde30344fa02815ee8bcd046f1703acaa7ac16e1b5d8c8",
      "text": "呐，大家看到粉丝们的\n反应了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000222:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a41c97a20b02c9ddbb3a5dd9a9fe3d31bdfa8f984bbbc83014812e1a065956aa",
      "text": "总觉得，正围绕着一个很有趣的话题\n聊得火热呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000224:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f223d1e45b7835c36dde79a21ecc132d87e553f872e8baa9a6393658f49c0553",
      "text": "…怎么会变成这样啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000226:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04c7ed6c21d0efbec3ea91277156fe6fca0a7d1a597b6a45db6fabf5205c2b8e",
      "text": "天使酱们的心情\n我也能理解哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000228:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d6aa8325f9e35dc6af6be0d250517f4780dc901892c9270b855d1dab93eef29",
      "text": "难道说……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000228:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c13cefb820fe7043a8c6f022952bc61155f370925aac2a91893bcdb8304f652",
      "text": "那个，难道说……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000231:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d719e2717f823e4b3dce546d6ce4cfa787a652f7137894fae2fe71d6fac73dbb",
      "text": "没错！\n就是“想听听我们的初恋小故事”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000233:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74ab88c1f8f8646a34a487d58c530b558208debc30b0793df30bc9c01b4b200b",
      "text": "大家都讨论得\n超级热烈呢～\n真让人伤脑筋啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000235:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97944687594352cde5c020a80931501e7df05bd31aed1fd1a42a7805ebd574f",
      "text": "冬马君他<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000237:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e663438c269724c3e9af0156273cda1176963290ce7d7da647634e53314a07a0",
      "text": "喂，翔太！\n伤脑筋的只有我一个人吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000239:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d98da57f3e63e2820ad6b89f225903bdbea45d54ce330be0f8b0696969309965",
      "text": "但是，大家能讨论得这么热烈\n还是很让人高兴的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_k:cmd-000241:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7c873baa3d41023306e79f2b8f4817eabdaf2bfca47d3fe481d553fac1718d4",
      "text": "什么时候挑个机会聊聊\n那种话题也很不错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
